# mtk/mt6768/drivers/storage/conf: the MT6768's storage.
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_<NAME>=y in a defconfig builds a driver into the kernel (docs/drivers-config.md). MediaTek's drivers are
# `default n`: a configuration has them only when it includes mt6768.config.

driver MTK_EMMC
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.mtk_emmc.c
	default n
	help    the eMMC through the MT6768's MSDC0, read only: the partition "xnusys" as /dev/emmc0, and with emmc_root=1 the root
	help    (the system image read as it is needed instead of held in memory). LK and mtkloader leave the card set up
